Functional Requirements

The system shall allow:

Patron (User)
1. Patrons to register and log in to the system.
2. Patrons to browse theatre events and view ticket details.
3. Patrons to book and purchase theatre tickets.
4. Patrons to update their user profile details.
5. Patrons to view upcoming bookings and booking history.
6. Patrons to cancel bookings (subject to booking conditions).

Administrator
7. Administrators to manage theatre event details (add, edit, and delete).
8. Administrators to manage ticket categories, prices, and seat availability.
9. Administrators to view and manage customer bookings.
10. Administrators to monitor ticket sales and payment statuses.
11. Administrators to manage patron accounts.
12. Administrators to generate ticket sales reports.
